    "testimonial_style_4_fkDVeW": {
      "type": "testimonial-style-4",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_box_6Re8Ar": {
          "type": "testimonial-box",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>I didn’t realize how annoying balancing my phone on the sink was until I got TapNest. Now I just snap it onto my mirror while I get ready in the morning. It honestly made my bathroom routine feel so much cleaner and easier.</p>",
            "customer_name": "Emily R., Los Angeles",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image_6d01c1e1-472c-4f93-b9e7-5646bcf2717c.png"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_box_V3eief": {
          "type": "testimonial-box",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>I use my phone for everything while getting ready — makeup tutorials, Spotify, FaceTime with friends. TapNest made it feel effortless. Strong magnet, super minimal look, and it actually stays put in a humid bathroom.</p>",
            "customer_name": "Sophie T., New York",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image2.png"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_box_dARwGh": {
          "type": "testimonial-box",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>This is one of those products that feels obvious after you use it. I used to prop my phone against random bottles and pray it wouldn’t fall into the sink. TapNest solved that instantly.</p>",
            "customer_name": "Rachel K., Chicago",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image3.png"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_box_tNF8JU": {
          "type": "testimonial-box",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>My bathroom counter is tiny, so having my phone mounted on the mirror instead of sitting in water or clutter is such a game changer. Also perfect for shower playlists and TikTok makeup inspo.”</p>",
            "customer_name": "Hannah L., Austin",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Morning_Routine_Mirror_Selfie.png"
          }
        }
      },
